  "description": "There are many ways to describe the relationship between Yu Mu-Gueon and Go Seo-Won. From childhood neighbors who lived next door, to seniors and juniors at the same high school, to coworkers at the same high school, and even as lovers. But the happiness that seemed like it would last forever was short-lived.\n\n*“Seo-Won, don’t push me away. Don’t hate me—you still love me, right?”*\n\nMu-Gyeon, who had been wagging his tail playfully, announces their breakup just before their 1,000th day together, and a rift begins to form between them...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
